ربية", "Français"], ["committed cost", "التكلفة الملتزم بها", "coût engagé"], ["design stage", "مرحلة التصميم", "phase de conception"], ["supply chain", "سلسلة التوريد", "chaîne d'approvisionnement"], ["abandonment", "إلغاء المشروع", "abandon du projet"]], [["Line", "Computation", "The squeeze bottle"], ["Target price", "What the market will pay", "6.40"], ["Capital employed", "Equipment, inventory, receivables", "3,000,000"], ["Required return", "Board's rate for new products", "18%"], ["Target operating income in total", "Capital times the rate", "540,000"], ["Forecast volume", "A year", "1,200,000 bottles"], ["Target operating income a unit", "Total over volume", "0.45"], ["Target cost a unit", "Price less target income", "5.95"], ["Estimated cost as designed", "From the engineers", "6.70"], ["Cost gap a unit", "Estimate less target", "0.75"], ["Cost gap a year", "Gap times volume", "900,000"]], [["English (exam term)", "العربية", "Français"], ["required return on new products", "العائد المطلوب للمنتجات الجديدة", "taux exigé sur les nouveaux produits"], ["life-cycle costing", "تكلفة دورة الحياة", "coût du cycle de vie"], ["forecast volume", "الحجم المتوقع", "volume prévisionnel"], ["scaling to the annual total", "التحويل إلى الإجمالي السنوي", "mise à l'échelle annuelle"]], [["Component", "As designed", "After value engineering", "Saving", "How"], ["Nozzle", "0.80", "0.55", "0.25", "Supplier's standard two-part design"], ["Bottle", "1.10", "0.95", "0.15", "Standard shape in place of a custom mould"], ["Label", "0.20", "0.12", "0.08", "Printed directly on the bottle"], ["Filling labour", "0.60", "0.45", "0.15", "Faster run, no tooling change"], ["Sauce", "3.00", "3.00", "Nil", "Protected: it is what the customer buys"], ["Allocated overhead", "1.00", "0.88", "0.12", "Fewer parts, one less handling step"], ["Total", "6.70", "5.95", "0.75", "Gap closed"]], [["English (exam term)", "العربية", "Français"], ["function analysis", "تحليل الوظائف", "analyse fonctionnelle"]